#, c-format
#| msgid "'%s' wants to pair with this device. Do you want to allow pairing?"
msgid "“%s” wants to pair with this device. Do you want to allow pairing?"
msgstr ""
"„%s“ želi da se upari sa ovim uređajem. Da li želite da dopustite uparivanje?"

